---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Picture from '../components/Picture.astro';
import ProductCard from '../components/ProductCard.astro';
import {products,categories} from '../data/catalogue';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Trailers for the load ahead">
 <section class="kk-hero"><div class="kk-hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA</p><h1>Built for the load.<br/><span>Ready for the road.</span></h1><p>Explore car transporters, box, cage, enclosed and trade trailer layouts built around real Australian requirements.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button" href="/shop/">Explore trailers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button outline light" href="/quote/">Get a quote</a></div></div><figure><Picture name="headquarters" alt="CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA concept headquarters and trailer range" hero/><figcaption>CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA concept illustration.</figcaption></figure></section>
 <nav class="quick-actions" aria-label="Homepage quick actions"><a href="/shop/"><span>01</span><small>EXPLORE THE RANGE</small><strong>Shop trailers</strong><i>→</i></a><a href="/quote/"><span>02</span><small>SALES ENQUIRY</small><strong>Get a quote</strong><i>→</i></a><a href="/locations/"><span>03</span><small>COLLECTION SUPPORT</small><strong>Find a location</strong><i>→</i></a><a href="/finance/"><span>04</span><small>PAYMENT OPTIONS</small><strong>Explore finance</strong><i>→</i></a></nav>
 <section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILT FOR EVERY JOB</p><h2>Shop by trailer type.</h2></div><p class="section-description">Start with the load. Compare the format. Confirm the specification before ordering.</p></div><div class="round-category-grid">{categories.map((c)=><a class="round-category" href={`/shop/?category=${c.slug}`}><span><Picture name={c.image} alt={`${c.name}, illustrative trailer design`}/></span><h3>{c.name}</h3><small>Explore range →</small></a>)}</div><div class="center-actions"><a class="button outline" href="/shop/">View all categories</a><a class="button" href="/shop/">Shop all trailers →</a></div></section>
 <section class="range-section"><div class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">CURRENT CAR TRAILERS RANGE</p><h2>Featured trailers.</h2></div><p class="section-description">Compare layouts, save a selection and request a configuration based on your load.</p></div><div class="product-grid four">{products.slice(0,4).map(p=><ProductCard product={p}/>)}</div><div class="center-actions"><a class="button dark" href="/shop/">Shop all trailers →</a></div></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap ownership-panel"><Picture name="headquarters" alt="CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA concept headquarters"/><div><p class="eyebrow">AN AUSTRALIAN TRAILER BUSINESS</p><h2>Purpose-built.<br/><span>Locally supported.</span></h2><p>CAR TRAILERS AUSTRALIA helps private buyers, trades and commercial operators compare trailer formats, prepare clear requirements and confirm the right configuration before purchase.</p><div class="stat-grid"><span><strong>AU</strong>Australian focus</span><span><strong>4</strong>Core ranges</span><span><strong>1:1</strong>Quote support</span><span><strong>B4L</strong>Company group</span></div><a class="button" href="/about/">About Car Trailers →</a></div></section>
 <section class="section wrap quality-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND THE JOB</p><h2>Practical products.<br/><span>Clear support.</span></h2><p>Each enquiry starts with your load, towing vehicle, access requirements and intended use. Final specifications, options, price and availability are documented before an order proceeds.</p><ol><li><strong>Load-first selection</strong><span>Choose a format around the equipment or vehicle you need to move.</span></li><li><strong>Configuration review</strong><span>Confirm dimensions, ratings, braking, finish and required equipment.</span></li><li><strong>After-sales pathway</strong><span>Keep your quote, order reference and support information together.</span></li></ol><div class="hero-buttons"><a class="button dark" href="/support/">View support</a><a class="button outline" href="/manuals/">User manuals</a></div></div><Picture name="cage-ramps" alt="Ramp and cage trailer concept"/></section>
 <section class="bulk-panel"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">BULK ORDERS & CUSTOM CONFIGURATIONS</p><h2>Business and fleet trailer requirements.</h2><p>Bring us the model type, quantities, dimensions, loads, access needs and delivery timetable. We will organise the requirements into one structured enquiry.</p><div class="bulk-grid"><div><span>01</span><strong>Multiple trailers</strong><p>Prepare one coordinated request for a business or fleet.</p></div><div><span>02</span><strong>Custom requirements</strong><p>Document storage, ramps, cages, access and operating conditions.</p></div><div><span>03</span><strong>Clear review process</strong><p>Confirm the specification, price and fulfilment pathway in writing.</p></div></div><a class="button" href="/bulk-orders/">Discuss your requirements →</a></div></section>
 <section class="wrap process section"><p class="eyebrow">FROM FIRST LOOK TO YOUR NEXT LOAD</p><div class="process-grid"><div><span>01</span><h3>Explore your options</h3><p>Find a trailer format suited to your load and working day.</p></div><div><span>02</span><h3>Work through the details</h3><p>Share the equipment, dimensions, towing vehicle and access requirements.</p></div><div><span>03</span><h3>Confirm your configuration</h3><p>Review the specification, price and collection or delivery arrangements before ordering.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
